      "description": "<p>Ronny Yordrix Guanipa Chrinos arrested by secret service after telling officers voices told him to kill Donald Trump</p><p>The US secret service said a suspect has been taken into custody and charged after officers found him in a vehicle near the White House with multiple guns, claiming he heard voices in his head telling him to kill Donald Trump.</p><p>The arrest Thursday night happened after secret service officers approached a man “acting suspicious” in a parked car, according to a Homeland Security statement. US officials said the suspect – Ronny Yordrix Guanipa Chrinos – went on to describe voices in his head that were telling him to come to the nation’s capital and kill the Republican president.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/nov/06/secret-service-man-in-custody-trump\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
